{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the three original integers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/5/ad5f4e2509b45800b7132daa026cef9bb72f352c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\le b \\le c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" />. Since the median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7dc0b4770b29eceaf197ec3016b35007d973a7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>The average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the sum is:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/a/24ae4462b681a8406491487c9b84b27f36529513.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a + 32 + c = 40 \\times 3 = 120 \\implies a + c = 88\\]\" width=\"335\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/1/1b19260aa2010208e13826ccf331f1e1601a643a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\le 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" />, the largest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> must satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/4/a844e89dbeb23bc91ebc1bb072514735eedc4b56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 88 - a \\ge 88 - 32 = 56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"209\" height=\"16\" />. This immediately eliminates choices (A) and (B).\n</p><p>When Tina replaces one number, the new average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0d6c36fdad9c2874053be46c7e4120f2edcf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, meaning the sum increases by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a65dd1a5d5615cdd60ef6ec97b94aa487a8d814.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(42 \\times 3) - 120 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p>\n<ul><li>If Tina increased <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the new smallest number would become <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/d/10d16958de30a1b4cf0ba78a0dd55791ca0a44b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. For the median to remain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/d/10d16958de30a1b4cf0ba78a0dd55791ca0a44b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> must not exceed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/ccc05022722ced679383353f5028802ec158d97d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\le 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/ccc05022722ced679383353f5028802ec158d97d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\le 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/0/1b0d12218450a8eeab360a0d6b1e5ca3380699e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 88 - a \\ge 62$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" />.</li>\n<li>If Tina increased <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the median naturally remains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> for any valid configuration.</li></ul>\n<p>Let's test the remaining boundary options for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p>\n<ul><li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/4/e14f556b3b426d75947984394b81af8c811b0c48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889b02cf1fc06c35b0822c3e6555b5d52091cfc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> was increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the set becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/e/90ea83122bf0da910e1b13e5ec5da90023bdc1d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{30, 32, 64\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" />, keeping the median at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> was increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the set becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0e8b631f0bd5ff53d1e8f2f84c8f40af96f35d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{24, 32, 70\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" />, also keeping the median at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. This creates an ambiguity.</li>\n<li>In standard puzzle design where a unique change is forced to maintain the median without cross-over ambiguity, the configuration targets the maximum variation boundary where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/2/4d2aca816aa1a61086a65907397d693489b5b246.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+6 = b = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"16\" />, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/d/34de3f7cadc42ac4088f3656e879ddfb9b0f1c42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 26$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/8/648d5cfa5cb53b7baa4351511d325ddedc907cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 62$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />.</li></ul>\n<p>The correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/c/8bc9e30c75ede29fe43a47c31fd41f2e6ac39592.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 62}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Icosahedron0288\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems\">2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034344\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 205/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7050/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37400:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034344 and revision id 291904. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}